<title>USA: Omaha hogs average price/weights - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs average price/weights - USDA.</headline>
<text>
<p>Omaha, NE	Thursday, August 14, 1997  Source:  USDA Market News</p>
<p>Omaha Hog Average cost and weight for Wed, August 13, 1997.</p>
<p>Barrows and gilts:</p>
<p>  247 lbs  55.75   Year ago:   245 lbs  60.56</p>
<p>All hogs:</p>
<p>  300 lbs  51.88   Year ago:   293 lbs  56.03</p>
<p>Source:  USDA Market News, Omaha, NE   (402) 731-4520</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
